{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的感受提示在部分段落过于密集，尤其S01，普通观众可能来不及逐条扫读；X的人物动机解释更完整，也更从容。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮短语建立了清楚的视觉入口，观众即使不逐字阅读，也能迅速抓住人物每一阶段的心理变化。更重要的是，Y把声部、节奏、音区、力度和水面、小船等意象结合起来，既呈现了细腻的音乐变化，也通过反复出现的意象和结尾对开头的呼应形成整体感。X的因果解释更充分，但感受描写相对概括，音乐细节与人物心理之间的对应也不如Y具体。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f09b9dbc-6b0d-46e7-9acb-790329da1760", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T200904177157Z", "elapsed_seconds": 47.735, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T20:09:51.917058+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f7a6f9af92394ea26e91d6fb952397c54bc4d4cf81047cbec589aa4f9f43c3f5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "ee